    "ComputeScaleSpaceCurvature[exr, sigma, opts] computes Koenderink \
scale-space / local-jet differential invariants (ShapeIndex, LogCurvedness, \
ScaleNormalizedCurvedness, k1, k2, H, K, KoenderinkCategory) at spatial \
aperture sigma (in pixels, or list of scales {s1, s2, ...}), using either \
\"Method\" -> \"WeingartenJet\" (3D manifold 1-jet on P and Nn) or \"Method\" \
-> \"MongeJet\" (2D Gaussian 2-jet J^2_sigma on depth Z).", "index" -> True|>|>,
